01:01:39.310 --> 01:01:48.290
I often, at a party at a total stranger's house, will start stacking plates, busting dirty cups, putting napkins in the trash bin, you know?
在陌生人家里聚会时，我经常会开始叠盘子、收脏杯子、把餐巾纸扔进垃圾桶，你懂吧？

1428
01:01:48.490 --> 01:01:51.570
Well, this is where we're similar because I do the same thing.
好吧，这一点我们很像，因为我也会做同样的事。

1429
01:01:51.850 --> 01:01:52.050
Yeah.
没错。

1430
01:01:52.410 --> 01:01:53.910
You know, someone did that to me once.
你知道吗，有次别人也对我做过这种事。

1431
01:01:54.010 --> 01:01:59.930
Like I had thrown a party and one of the moms went around and was like tidying kind of near the end.
我当时办了个派对，其中一位妈妈在派对快结束时到处转悠，开始收拾东西。

1432
01:02:00.110 --> 01:02:00.270
Yeah.
是啊。

1433
01:02:00.450 --> 01:02:01.990
And I was like, oh my gosh.
我当时心想，天哪。

1434
01:02:02.170 --> 01:02:05.210
