这一下子就帮我分担了25%的清理工作。

1435
01:02:05.470 --> 01:02:07.090
And it was such a nice gesture.
那真是一个非常贴心的举动。

1436
01:02:07.570 --> 01:02:09.350
So now I like to do it too.
所以现在我也喜欢这么做。

1437
01:02:09.550 --> 01:02:13.150
When I leave a party, I'll first do a sweep.
离开派对前，我会先扫视一圈。

1438
01:02:13.330 --> 01:02:13.710
Yes.
是的。

1439
01:02:13.850 --> 01:02:16.450
And get rid of all the empty cans and glasses and things.
把所有的空罐子、杯子之类的东西清理掉。

1440
01:02:16.450 --> 01:02:17.650
Stack the plastic cups.
把塑料杯叠起来。

1441
01:02:17.790 --> 01:02:18.050
Yes.
没错。

1442
01:02:18.150 --> 01:02:19.470
Put stuff by the sink.
把东西放到水槽边。

1443
01:02:19.630 --> 01:02:19.910
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1444
01:02:20.210 --> 01:02:20.650
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1445
01:02:20.770 --> 01:02:21.170
I know.
我懂。

1446
01:02:21.430 --> 01:02:23.130
I related to Angela in that moment.
那一刻我很有共鸣，安吉拉。

1447
01:02:23.250 --> 01:02:26.310
But I love how she's like, am I not supposed to have any fun?
