1470
01:03:21.230 --> 01:03:26.510
And they thought it was a funny way to end this storyline of Dwight trying to heal her.
就像是，德怀特的治疗并不是治愈的方法，跳舞甚至也不是问题所在。

1471
01:03:27.070 --> 01:03:31.510
Like, Dwight's treatments weren't the cure, and the dancing wasn't even the problem.
没错。

1472
01:03:31.930 --> 01:03:32.050
Right.
就像是，反正她也会因为承受这点压力而闪到腰，

1473
01:03:32.110 --> 01:03:35.950
Like, she was going to throw her back out anyway from just holding on to this little stress,
